{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1537","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"人的作为","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"推其根本","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"后唐庄宗李存勖（885—926），五代后唐王朝的建立者，923年至926年在位","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"李存勖之父李克用，沙陀部人（他的父亲姓朱邪，名赤心，有功于唐朝，赐姓名为李国昌），因出兵帮助唐朝镇压黄巢起义，受封为晋王","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"梁王朱温是我的仇敌。梁，黄巢部将朱温，投降唐朝，赐名全忠，受封为梁王。唐僖宗时，他设计谋杀李克用，李克用也屡次上表请求讨伐他。李克用曾长期与朱温交战","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"刘仁恭本来是幽州将领，借李克用的势力夺取幽州，任卢龙节度使。后来刘仁恭归附朱温，他的儿子刘守光开始称燕王，后来称帝。这里称刘仁恭为燕王，是笼统的说法","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"李克用和契丹首领耶律阿保机订立盟约，结为兄弟，希望共同举兵攻打朱温。后来阿保机背盟，派人和朱温通好","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"副词，表示祈使语气","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"官名，这里泛指一般属官","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"羊、猪各一头。古代祭祀用牛、羊、猪各一头叫“太牢”，用羊、猪各一头叫“少牢”。牢，祭祀用的牲畜","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"天子或诸侯遇出巡、战争等重大事件而祭告祖庙","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"恭敬地取出他父亲（留下）的箭。请，敬辞，用以代替某些动词，表示恭敬、慎重","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"把箭收藏（在祖庙里）","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"用绳索捆绑着刘仁恭、刘守光父子。911年，刘守光自称大燕皇帝。913年，李存勖派兵攻破幽州，俘获刘仁恭及其族人；刘守光逃到沧州，仍被捕获。父子都被处死。系，缚。组，丝带、丝绳，这里泛指绳索","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"用木匣子装着后梁皇帝、大臣的头。923年，后唐军队攻入开封。后梁末帝朱友贞命令部将皇甫麟杀死自己。皇甫麟杀了末帝，随后自杀。函，匣子，这里用作动词，用匣子装","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"仇人。雠，与“仇”同义","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"一个人夜里呼喊，作乱的人四方响应。926年，屯驻在贝州（今河北清河）的后唐军士皇甫晖勾结党羽作乱，拥立指挥使赵在礼为帅，攻入邺都（今河南安阳）。邢州（今河北邢台）、沧州（今属河北）驻军相继叛乱","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"皇甫晖作乱以后，李存勖从洛阳往东逃，到了万胜镇（在今河南中牟），听说李嗣源（李克用养子，当时已叛变）已经占据大梁（今河南开封），只好命令军队返回。一路上士兵叛逃，失散了一半。至洛阳附近，置酒痛哭。诸将一百多人相对号泣，都截断头发，放在地上，表示誓死以报","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-18"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"或者，还是","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-19"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"考察，探究","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-20"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"都出自人的原因吗？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-21"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"语出《尚书·大禹谟》。原句是“满招损，谦受益”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-22"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"安乐。指李存勖喜好音律，宠用伶人，以至自傅粉墨，与伶人共戏于庭","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-23"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"全，整个","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-24"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"伶人郭从谦趁李嗣源攻占大梁，李存勖众叛亲离之际，起兵作乱。李存勖率兵抵御，被乱箭射死","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-25"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"李存勖死后，李嗣源即位（即后唐明宗），群臣中有人劝他自建国号，此事虽未实行，但是庄宗死后，李克用嫡亲子孙都被杀，也可以说是“国灭”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-26"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"极小的事。忽，一寸的十万分之一。微，一寸的百万分之一","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-27"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"所溺爱的人或物。溺，沉湎、无节制","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10270-28"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"呜呼！盛衰之理，虽曰天命，岂非人事","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-10270-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"哉！原","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-10270-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"庄宗","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-10270-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之所以得天下，与其所以失之者，可以知之矣。\n\n世言晋王","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-10270-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之将终也，以三矢赐庄宗而告之曰：“梁，吾仇也","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-10270-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"；燕王吾所立","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-10270-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，契丹与吾约为兄弟","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-10270-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，而皆背晋以归梁。此三者，吾遗恨也。与尔三矢，尔其","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-10270-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"无忘乃父之志！”庄宗受而藏之于庙。其后用兵，则遣从事","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-10270-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"以一少牢","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-10270-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"告庙","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-10270-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，请其矢","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-10270-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，盛以锦囊，负而前驱，及凯旋而纳之","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-10270-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n方其系燕父子以组","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-10270-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，函梁君臣之首","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-10270-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，入于太庙，还矢先王，而告以成功，其意气之盛，可谓壮哉！及仇雠","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-10270-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"已灭，天下已定，一夫夜呼，乱者四应","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-10270-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，仓皇东出，未及见贼而士卒离散，君臣相顾，不知所归，至于誓天断发，泣下沾襟","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-10270-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，何其衰也！岂得之难而失之易欤？抑","type":"text"},{"label":"[19]","noteId":"footnote-10270-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"本","type":"text"},{"label":"[20]","noteId":"footnote-10270-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"其成败之迹，而皆自于人欤","type":"text"},{"label":"[21]","noteId":"footnote-10270-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？《书》曰：“满招损，谦得益","type":"text"},{"label":"[22]","noteId":"footnote-10270-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。”忧劳可以兴国，逸豫","type":"text"},{"label":"[23]","noteId":"footnote-10270-23","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"可以亡身，自然之理也。\n\n故方其盛也，举","type":"text"},{"label":"[24]","noteId":"footnote-10270-24","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"天下之豪杰，莫能与之争；及其衰也，数十伶人困之","type":"text"},{"label":"[25]","noteId":"footnote-10270-25","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，而身死国灭","type":"text"},{"label":"[26]","noteId":"footnote-10270-26","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，为天下笑。夫祸患常积于忽微","type":"text"},{"label":"[27]","noteId":"footnote-10270-27","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，而智勇多困于所溺","type":"text"},{"label":"[28]","noteId":"footnote-10270-28","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，岂独伶人也哉？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"历史上有一些朝代，“其兴也勃焉，其亡也忽焉”（《左传》），如秦朝，如五代之后唐，其速亡的历史教训令后人感叹不已，常引以为鉴。《过秦论》和《五代史伶官传序》两篇文章，分别对秦朝和后唐灭亡的历史教训进行总结，得出了各自的结论。阅读课文，注意联系作者所处的时代背景，把握文章的主要观点及写作意图。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《过秦论》铺陈历史，形成对比和反差，水到渠成得出结论；《五代史伶官传序》纵说盛衰之理，却从一个细微的角度切入。《过秦论》以赋体写史论，多用夸张、对比，通篇一气贯注，气势充沛，铺张扬厉；《五代史伶官传序》以散体写史论，文字平易晓畅，简洁生动，感慨遥深。两种不同文体的写作方法和论述风格各具特色，须反复诵读，细加体会。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"在现代汉语中，名词一般不作状语，但在古汉语中，名词作状语的现象时有出现。如“天下云集响应，赢粮而景从”中的“云”“响”“景”，均为名词作状语，意为“像云一样（集合）”“像回声一样（回应）”“像影子一样（跟随）”。从课文中再找一些例子，体会这种用法的特点。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"背诵《过秦论》。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《新五代史·伶官传》（中华书局2000 年版）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《新五代史》是二十四史之一，记载907 年至960 年间后梁、后唐、后晋、后汉、后周五代的历史。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本文是《新五代史·伶官传》开头的短序。古称演戏的人为伶，在宫廷中授有官职的伶人叫作伶官。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e4%ba%94%e4%bb%a3%e5%8f%b2%e4%bc%b6%e5%ae%98%e4%bc%a0%e5%ba%8f-%e6%ac%a7%e9%98%b3%e4%bf%ae","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e4%ba%94%e4%bb%a3%e5%8f%b2%e4%bc%b6%e5%ae%98%e4%bc%a0%e5%ba%8f-%e6%ac%a7%e9%98%b3%e4%bf%ae","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e4%ba%94%e4%bb%a3%e5%8f%b2%e4%bc%b6%e5%ae%98%e4%bc%a0%e5%ba%8f-%e6%ac%a7%e9%98%b3%e4%bf%ae","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10270,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-1","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-2","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-3","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-4","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-5","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-6","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-7","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-8","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-9","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-9","text":"[9]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-10","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-10","text":"[10]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-11","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-11","text":"[11]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-12","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-12","text":"[12]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-13","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-13","text":"[13]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-14","postId":10270,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10270-14","text":"[14]","title":